  "limitations": "No production price mutation or fitted elasticity. Competitor simulation is a bounded one-step undercut rule, not a solved Bertrand equilibrium. Observed competitor data is mandatory for that mode. Conflicting margin and price-change constraints abstain for human review. Recommendation age is explicit; no external price feed or live stock connector.",
